        548,
        1456,
        1301,
        1529
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 4. Executive Order No. 41 dated September 30, 1975, is hereby revoked, provided, however, that nothing in this Executive Order shall be construed to affect the validity of any act performed pursuant to such Executive Order and prior to the date hereof.",
